@startuml Reserve Stock on OutboundOrderCreated

title 消費 OutboundOrderCreatedIntegrationEvent → TryReserve → 回覆 Reserved/Failed（跨兩個 bounded context 的完整往返）

box "Ordering" #WhiteSmoke
    participant "OutboxProcessor" as OrderingOutbox
    participant "IntegrationEventConsumer" as OrderingConsumer
end box

queue "Kafka\ntopic: ordering.events" as OrderingTopic
queue "Kafka\ntopic: inventory.events" as InventoryTopic

box "Inventory" #LightYellow
    participant "IntegrationEventConsumer" as Consumer
    participant "IPublisher" as Publisher
    participant "OutboundOrderCreated\nIntegrationEventHandler" as Handler
    participant "InboxGuard" as Inbox
    participant "IStockRepository" as Repo
    participant "Stock" as StockAggregate
    participant "IIntegrationEventWriter" as Writer
    participant "OutboxProcessor" as InventoryOutbox
end box

database "inventory_db" as DB

OrderingOutbox -> OrderingTopic : produce OutboundOrderCreatedIntegrationEvent
activate Consumer
OrderingTopic -> Consumer : consumer.Consume()

Consumer -> Inbox : BeginIfNotProcessedAsync(uow, inbox, notification.Id, ct)
alt 已處理過
    Inbox --> Consumer : false
    note right of Consumer : 直接 return，不呼叫 PublishAsync
else 尚未處理
    Inbox --> Consumer : true（transaction 保持開啟）

    Consumer -> Publisher : PublishAsync(notification, ct)
    Publisher -> Handler : HandleAsync(notification, ct)

    loop 每個 OutboundOrderItem
        Handler -> Repo : GetOrCreateAsync(productId, warehouseId, ct)
        Repo --> Handler : (Stock, isNew)
        Handler -> StockAggregate : TryReserve(quantity)

        alt Quantity < quantity（庫存不足）
            StockAggregate --> Handler : Result.Failure（累積到 insufficientProductIds）
        else 足夠
            StockAggregate -> StockAggregate : Quantity -= quantity\nCumulativeShipped += quantity
            StockAggregate --> Handler : Result.Success
        end
    end

    alt insufficientProductIds 非空（整張單一起判斷，不允許部分成功）
        Handler -> DB : RollbackAsync(ct)（剛才所有 TryReserve 全部作廢）
        Handler -> DB : BeginAsync(ct)（開新的乾淨 transaction）
        Handler -> Writer : WriteAsync(OutboundInventoryReservationFailedIntegrationEvent)
        Writer -> DB : insert into outbox_messages（同一個新 transaction）
        Handler -> Inbox : MarkProcessedAsync(notification.Id, ct)
        Handler -> DB : CommitAsync(ct)
    else 全部成功
        loop 每個已預留成功的 Stock
            Handler -> Repo : AddAsync / SaveAsync(stock, ct)
            Repo -> DB : insert/update stocks
        end
        Handler -> Writer : WriteAsync(OutboundInventoryReservedIntegrationEvent)
        Writer -> DB : insert into outbox_messages（同一個 transaction）
        Handler -> Inbox : MarkProcessedAsync(notification.Id, ct)
        Handler -> DB : CommitAsync(ct)
    end
    Publisher --> Consumer : 完成
end

Consumer -> OrderingTopic : consumer.Commit(result)
deactivate Consumer

... 獨立的背景輪詢（每 5 秒），跟上面的消費流程沒有時間上的耦合 ...

activate InventoryOutbox
InventoryOutbox -> DB : outboxStore.ListAsync(50, ct)
DB --> InventoryOutbox : 剛寫入的 Reserved / Failed 訊息
InventoryOutbox -> InventoryTopic : produce\n(EventType header)
InventoryOutbox -> DB : message.Process() → SaveAsync(message, ct)
deactivate InventoryOutbox

InventoryTopic -> OrderingConsumer : consumer.Consume()
OrderingConsumer -> OrderingConsumer : PublishAsync → \nOutboundOrder.MarkReserved() 或 FailReservation()
note right of OrderingConsumer
  Processing → Pending（Reserved）
  或
  Processing → Rejected（ReservationFailed）
  見 docs/ordering/aggregates.puml
end note

@enduml
